I've done a little cataloguing as I played NetHack on my machine of what  
scroll names correspond to what scrolls, potion colors to potions, etc.   
This is what I have to date, but I have an idea that NetHack has a certain  
number of descriptions that it randomly assigns to a certain number of  
functions each time a new game is begun, in order to foil attempts just  
like this one.  If anybody out there has any information about this, please  
let me know.....
Ignore letters in parentheses- they simply signify the call letter of the  
object so I could ID it if I died (which I do quite often since I am a  
relatively new player)

PS- Anybody know where I can get some good spoilers to help my game?????

